// OAKES_MONTROSE_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2232328001" "You sure those ain't loaded??"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P920395419" "Finally!  Some distraction!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P36422625" "You're gonna get your teeth knocked out!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
