// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3799884550" "Oh, you thought you were sooo much better than the Mooks."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2936426407" "You Marcone guys.  You ain't nothin'."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P30440240" "Montrose ain't big enough for both of us.  Let me show you how it's gonna go."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2579793286" "Marcone's time has come.  It's our time now."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3515220991" "Mind your own business!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1836562057" "You gotta be kidding me!  Step on it, why don't you?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4277026097" "You got no place in Mook territory!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2003562589" "One day Marcone will pay."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P988062609" "I'm bored.  You bored?"
